+         Red cells (i+j even) depend only on:
+         - Black cells from (i-1,j), (i,j-1), (i-1,j-1) [already computed]
+         - Red cells from (i-1,j+1), (i+1,j-1) [not yet computed, but read as old values]
+         - (i+1,j) and (i,j+1) [old values from previous time step]
+         Disjoint red cells have independent writes. */
+
+      /* Pass 1: compute and update all red cells (i+j even) in parallel. */
+      #pragma omp parallel for collapse(2) schedule(static)
